479-d316-4fe0-ae67-1b75e02bdfde","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"別リポジトリなるほど","ts":"1618462475.223000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gIBL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"71873d44-533a-4736-a86c-986eccbb8d1a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"当面の確認を別ブランチでやるのと、最後はやっぱり必要だとは思います...、あるいはダミーの別リポジトリで試すとか","ts":"1618462306.222800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":2,"users":["UL6CFN8NR","U01TQP86UM6"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"njYS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2988e556-d42d-4935-a4a9-de87f10e1701","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"releaseのCIの設定の試行錯誤とか・・・","ts":"1618460693.222000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MQ+e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"90dc6a6d-d14e-4eb1-bee0-feda0d63039d","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"mainでCI走らせたいときのGitHub Actionsの設定を試行錯誤するときとかにforce pushしたくなるんだけど、こういう場合っていいやり方あります？","ts":"1618460686.221700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bAw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f2fa216-152e-42da-83fb-683ef972fe58","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"force pushはヤバい","ts":"1618460463.220600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KTNIR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bfd5f534-f4d3-4f81-8401-e7bca12191bc","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"たまに force-push したりしてるけど、やっぱり控えたほうがよさそうですね。","ts":"1618459388.220500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UWNgW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"98c0a3d7-bd51-4b8d-b89e-ec67b0832d1e","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"(ffじゃないとpullしない設定ではあるようなので)","ts":"1618453161.219800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0uuH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ba4e8477-94f3-473e-91d3-b99969b05e38","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"自動マージなpullのときはOKだと見過す人は多そうだけど、なぜだ...","ts":"1618453140.219300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cl0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9bebf096-31b9-4ecb-b53f-c1695fe01758","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"Bram が force push するとは思えないし。","ts":"1618453124.218900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"t7SE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"503d9f31-be6f-49cf-ac8e-6b230440f768","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あれえ?","ts":"1618453120.218600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/oyMW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e73f3b86-b577-49ae-a892-5850cc7feb1a","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"僕もそう思ってるんですが、vim のリポジトリでもたまに起きるんですよね。","ts":"1618453113.218300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hMATv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e4af6878-976b-4805-a42a-934014ee8592","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なにかあってmasterなりがforce-pushされて、pull失敗じゃない?","ts":"1618453065.216900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"64e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a73802f9-6df0-40a7-9ff3-b4f87a8f52cc","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"たまに pull しかしてないリポジトリで\n```fatal: Not possible to fast-forward, aborting.```\nが出るのどういう理由なんだっけ。","ts":"1618453037.216500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3i7Jf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1fc7d8a0-0e2f-4d43-b119-0d4255acbbea","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"更新したら消えた。","ts":"1618452963.216100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Fet"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aaa1c4cf-159a-48aa-a695-0d6df90c56bb","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"あれ？僕がやらかしかな？","ts":"1618452929.215900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ns9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be986a5e-81a1-4f20-af64-7eef0d9bd377","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"vitalはautoloadしかないので、害もないけど、分離もしやすいだろうというのもあるけど、まあ気がむいたらw","ts":"1618452797.215600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AtsL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9ed06c0c-28b7-48d6-b297-aee8066053b6","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"たしかに spec ディレクトリ切って移動させてもいいかもしれませんね。。。以前 `plugin/vsnip.vim` と `plugin/vsnip.vimspec` をおいてたら、どっちも起動時に実行されるというのですごい動きをしていたことがあります。。。","ts":"1618452613.214900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JLJj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7cb2d326-6a07-4a80-9dff-7392312f0d17","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ、ですね。\nvital.vim、vital-whisky、自前と別にしてたのを見てたので、ちょっとだけ気になっただけです。","ts":"1618452566.214100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nZYZi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43abcea5-6c9c-4bac-8e99-66d4e5a8156c","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"vital-vs は出荷時（埋め込み時）は vimspec ファイルが同梱されないので耐える予定なんですよね。。。","ts":"1618452409.213200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GMwe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9df073e6-cf33-40d7-bef4-99fc2351f17d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なんでしょね...\nただ `vim-vital-vs` 見てて、テストコードがautoload下に含まれてるのはちょっと気になった...巻き込むことはないから問題はないはずだけど","ts":"1618451920.212100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"reC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1252a4d4-085f-41ae-ab11-2e2aeab3b688","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"mattn氏がふるいの使ってるとか","ts":"1618451734.211100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NIiHH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"16b5f3fd-a689-4ab6-b29f-fec92bcf018a","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"あれ、でも themis#log の記述が見つけられない。。。","ts":"1618451649.211000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yUo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8c820a94-99ce-4613-b908-9a6544e73c29","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"うあああ。なおします！","ts":"1618451005.210500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U78A6ESHM"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hZgr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7ea1ed36-c227-49af-aeed-5e729f9a4db6","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"修正漏れでは","ts":"1618446557.210400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0CLKV"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"vsnip でエラー出たけど themis 必須という事かな？","ts":"1618444663.210100","files":[{"id":"F01TXM9LFP1","created":1618444660,"timestamp":1618444660,"name":"image.png","title":"image.png","mimetype":"image/png","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"png","pretty_type":"PNG","user":"U03C6TEAZ","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":48014,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F01TXM9LFP1/image.png","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F01TXM9LFP1/download/image.png","original_h":137,"original_w":1952,"thumb_64":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F01TXM9LFP1-172825efeb/image_64.png","thumb_80":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F01TXM9LFP1-172825efeb/image_80.png","thumb_160":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F01TXM9LFP1-172825efeb/image_160.png","thumb_360